Bundled fonts
-------------

The event site bundles 24 self-hosted font families as woff2 files. The
documentation site (GitHub Pages) bundles three: Bricolage Grotesque,
Source Sans 3 and IBM Plex Mono. Each family is licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org). The families, their
designers and their licence files are listed in
apps/web/public/fonts/README.md (the event site) and docs/fonts/README.md
(the documentation site).

The client console bundles two font families to draw the agreement PDF:

  Noto Sans     SIL Open Font License 1.1
  DejaVu Sans   Bitstream Vera license, with public domain changes

Their licence texts and the record of how the files were made are in
console/functions/fonts/.
